ved",". See the ",[312,407,314],{"href":408},"\u002Fguides\u002Fwebhooks#event-types"," for the full list.",[328,411,412,417,422],{},[346,413,414],{},[307,415,416],{},"reason",[346,418,419],{},[307,420,421],{},"string | null",[346,423,424,425,428,429,432,433,397,436,401,439,442],{},"Why the event fired, for events with more than one cause. Always present; ",[307,426,427],{},"null"," for every event except ",[307,430,431],{},"subscription.updated",", where it is ",[307,434,435],{},"updated_immediately",[307,437,438],{},"updated_on_renewal",[307,440,441],{},"renewed",". New values may be added over time.",[328,444,445,450,454],{},[346,446,447],{},[307,448,449],{},"entityType",[346,451,452],{},[307,453,355],{},[346,455,456,457,397,460,397,463,397,466,397,469,401,472,315],{},"The resource type the event refers to, such as ",[307,458,459],{},"order",[307,461,462],{},"refund",[307,464,465],{},"subscription",[307,467,468],{},"checkout",[307,470,471],{},"one_off_product",[307,473,474],{},"subscription_plan",[328,476,477,482,486],{},[346,478,479],{},[307,480,481],{},"entityId",[346,483,484],{},[307,485,355],{},[346,487,488],{},"The ID of the related resource.",[328,490,491,496,500],{},[346,492,493],{},[307,494,495],{},"object",[346,497,498],{},[307,499,495],{},[346,501,502,503,505,506,509,510,512,513,516,517,315],{},"The full resource payload as it existed when the event occurred (an Order, Chargeback, Refund, Subscription, Checkout, OneOffProduct, or SubscriptionPlan), keyed by its own ",[307,504,369],{}," field. Note ",[307,507,508],{},"object.resource"," can differ from ",[307,511,449],{},": chargeback events carry ",[307,514,515],{},"entityType: order"," but a Chargeback ",[307,518,495],{},[328,520,521,526,530],{},[346,522,523],{},[307,524,525],{},"createdAt",[346,527,528],{},[307,529,355],{},[346,531,532],{},"When the event occurred (ISO 8601 format).",[328,534,535,540,545],{},[346,536,537],{},[307,538,539],{},"testmode",[346,541,542],{},[307,543,544],{},"boolean",[346,